      "source": "Returns a new <a href=\"../../util/TypeScanner.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.util\"><code>TypeScanner</code></a> used to scan for <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Class.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>types</code></a> that will be contributed to the AOT\nprocessing infrastructure.",
