    {
      "source": "Obtain a <a href=\"../../aot/AotTypeConfiguration.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.aot\"><code>AotTypeConfiguration</code></a> for the given <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/ResolvableType.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.core\"><code>ResolvableType</code></a> to customize the AOT processing for the\ngiven type.",
      "translation": "获取一个针对给定 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/ResolvableType.html\" title=\"类或接口在 org.springframework.core\"><code>ResolvableType</code></a> 的 <a href=\"../../aot/AotTypeConfiguration.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.aot 中的接口\"><code>AotTypeConfiguration</code></a>，以自定义该类型的 AOT 处理。",
