    {
      "source": "Obtain a <a href=\"../../aot/AotTypeConfiguration.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.aot\"><code>AotTypeConfiguration</code></a> for the given <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/ResolvableType.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.core\"><code>ResolvableType</code></a> to customize the AOT processing for the\ngiven type. Repeated calls to the same type will result in merging the configuration.",
      "translation": "获取给定 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/ResolvableType.html\" title=\"类或接口 org.springframework.core\"><code>ResolvableType</code></a> 的 <a href=\"../../aot/AotTypeConfiguration.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.aot 中的接口\"><code>AotTypeConfiguration</code></a>，以自定义该类型的 AOT 处理。对同一类型进行重复调用将合并配置。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Create a new <code>AotRepositoryContextSupport</code> given the <a href=\"../../aot/AotContext.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.aot\"><code>AotContext</code></a>.",
      "translation": "根据 <a href=\"../../aot/AotContext.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.aot\"><code>AotContext</code></a> 创建一个新的 <code>AotRepositoryContextSupport</code>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Checks if repository code generation is enabled for a given module by checking environment variables for general\nenablement (<a href=\"../../aot/AotContext.html#GENERATED_REPOSITORIES_ENABLED\"><code>AotContext.GENERATED_REPOSITORIES_ENABLED</code></a>) and store-specific ones following the pattern\nspring.aot.&amp;lt;module-name&amp;gt;.repositories.enabled.",
      "translation": "检查是否已为给定模块启用仓库代码生成，方法是检查环境变量：首先检查通用启用标志（<a href=\"../../aot/AotContext.html#GENERATED_REPOSITORIES_ENABLED\"><code>AotContext.GENERATED_REPOSITORIES_ENABLED</code></a>），然后检查遵循模式 spring.aot.&amp;lt;module-name&amp;gt;.repositories.enabled 的特定存储库相关变量。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Checks if repository metadata file writing is enabled by checking environment variables for general enablement\n(<a href=\"../../aot/AotContext.html#GENERATED_REPOSITORIES_JSON_ENABLED\"><code>AotContext.GENERATED_REPOSITORIES_JSON_ENABLED</code></a>)",
      "translation": "检查是否启用了存储库元数据文件的写入，通过检查环境变量中的通用启用状态（<a href=\"../../aot/AotContext.html#GENERATED_REPOSITORIES_JSON_ENABLED\"><code>AotContext.GENERATED_REPOSITORIES_JSON_ENABLED</code></a>）",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "the <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/ClassLoader.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>ClassLoader</code></a> used by this <a href=\"../../aot/AotContext.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.aot\"><code>AotContext</code></a> to resolve <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Class.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>types</code></a>.",
