    {
      "source": "<a href=\"../../aot/AotContext.html#GENERATED_REPOSITORIES_ENABLED\"><code>AotContext.GENERATED_REPOSITORIES_ENABLED</code></a> acts as a main switch, if disabled, store specific flags have no effect.",
      "translation": "<a href=\"../../aot/AotContext.html#GENERATED_REPOSITORIES_ENABLED\"><code>AotContext.GENERATED_REPOSITORIES_ENABLED</code></a> 作为主开关，若将其禁用，则存储的特定标志将不产生任何效果。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Returns the <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/ClassLoader.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>ClassLoader</code></a> used by this <a href=\"../../aot/AotContext.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.aot\"><code>AotContext</code></a> to resolve <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Class.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>types</code></a>. By default, this is\nthe same <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/ClassLoader.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>ClassLoader</code></a> used by the <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/beans/factory/BeanFactory.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.beans.factory\"><code>BeanFactory</code></a> to resolve <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Class.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>types</code></a> declared in bean\ndefinitions.",
      "translation": "返回此 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/ClassLoader.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>ClassLoader</code></a> 用于解析 <a href=\"../../aot/AotContext.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.aot\"><code>AotContext</code></a> 的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Class.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>types</code></a>。默认情况下，这是与 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/beans/factory/BeanFactory.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.beans.factory\"><code>BeanFactory</code></a> 用于解析 bean 定义中声明的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Class.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>types</code></a> 相同的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/ClassLoader.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>ClassLoader</code></a>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Returns the required <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/ClassLoader.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>ClassLoader</code></a> used by this <a href=\"../../aot/AotContext.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.aot\"><code>AotContext</code></a> to resolve <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Class.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>types</code></a>. By\ndefault, this is the same <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/ClassLoader.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>ClassLoader</code></a> used by the <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/beans/factory/BeanFactory.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.beans.factory\"><code>BeanFactory</code></a> to resolve <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Class.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>types</code></a>\ndeclared in bean definitions.",
